_:nf28beac572234ec7bf6040c288510e91b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n        The reference formulation (rml:referenceFormulation) defines how to\r\n        reference to elements of the data of the input source.\r\n        " .
_:n859b882614ee44c88931e9ea04fbec9db1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Only one of rml:template, rml:constant, or rml:reference is allowed.\n        " .
