_:ne307b22402bd481f96aaddf308b37e68b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:template must be a string with well-formed brace delimiters:\n        every unescaped '{' must be closed by an unescaped '}' with no\n        unescaped braces in between, and every literal '{', '}', or '\\'\n        (both inside and outside reference expressions) must be\n        backslash-escaped.\n        " .
_:nb2650ec591b841419d0cfba9b921fc16b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
