_:nf279b122341f44f29568f972c8f49786b3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        At least one rml:field property must be specified for a rml:LogicalViewJoin, with a leaf expression field as its value.\r\n        " .
_:n9442bfdb72d54878ade63cb08a2bab41b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        Exactly one rml:targetFields property must be specified for each rml:InclusionAnnotation.\r\n        " .
_:nf28beac572234ec7bf6040c288510e91b2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n        The logical iterator (rml:iterator) defines the iteration loop used to \r\n        map the data of the input source. Depends on the reference formulation\r\n        if an iterator is necessary.  \r\n        " .
