_:n3b96ec1c54364defa887fd32efa9a1dbb2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:root defines the root against which a relative rml:path is\n        resolved: rml:CurrentWorkingDirectory, rml:MappingDirectory, or an\n        absolute path string Literal. Defaults to\n        rml:CurrentWorkingDirectory if not specified.\n        " .
_:nec89f505252045719267c6a697271134b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        At least one rml:predicate or rml:predicateMap must be provided.\n        " .
_:n78bb2eb9a6d74b6fa230e15159646599b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:mode specifies in which mode the target is opened such as read-only,\n        write-only, both, etc.\n        " .
